~~~/README.md
# Interactive Vertical Accordion Gallery

A highly interactive, production-ready vertical accordion gallery component. It features smooth flex-basis transitions for expanding/collapsing items, staggered text reveal animations, and a responsive layout that shifts from side-anchored content on desktop to internal image overlays on mobile.

## Dependencies
- React 18+
- Tailwind CSS 3+

## Props & Types
This component currently accepts no props but can easily be extended to accept an `items` array.

```typescript
interface GalleryItem {
  id: string;
  category?: string;
  title: string;
  description: string;
  image: string;
  link: string;
}
```

## Example Usage
```tsx
import { AccordionGallery } from '@/sd-components/accordion-gallery';

function Page() {
  return (
    <main className="bg-[#0b0b0b] min-h-screen">
      <AccordionGallery />
    </main>
  );
}
```
